WEBVTT

01:31.360 --> 01:34.100
[Episode 19]

01:43.879 --> 01:46.280
The guests who usually come

01:46.280 --> 01:50.200
are either rich but ugly, unbearably vulgar,

01:50.200 --> 01:55.120
or handsome but broke, with empty pockets.

01:55.120 --> 01:58.719
It is rare to see a guest like you,

01:58.719 --> 02:01.719
who is both wealthy and good-looking.

02:01.719 --> 02:03.719
I don't believe it.

02:03.719 --> 02:08.539
Miss Xiang Ning, I hear your admirers
are all either rich or powerful.

02:09.719 --> 02:13.039
Even that renowned leader of the Huxiao Gang

02:13.039 --> 02:15.080
has been utterly captivated by you

02:15.080 --> 02:16.979
and often comes to support you.

02:17.680 --> 02:21.199
The court is offering ten thousand taels
for that villain's capture.

02:21.199 --> 02:24.539
If I knew him,
I would have been rich already.

02:28.840 --> 02:31.960
Miss Xiang Ning,
you have such talent and beauty.

02:31.960 --> 02:34.400
If he truly kept you in his heart,

02:34.400 --> 02:37.319
he wouldn't bear
to leave you at Wanxiang Pavilion.

02:37.319 --> 02:39.360
If it were me,

02:39.360 --> 02:42.780
I would build a golden house to keep you.

02:44.560 --> 02:46.080
To be honest,

02:46.080 --> 02:48.759
I have seen the portrait on the wall.

02:48.759 --> 02:52.240
That gang leader
is actually quite a handsome man.

02:52.240 --> 02:55.500
If I had seen him, I would surely not forget.

02:57.240 --> 03:00.280
However, by comparison,

03:00.280 --> 03:03.120
you are even more delectable

03:03.120 --> 03:07.360
and truly a delight to behold.

03:07.360 --> 03:10.919
But whether I can leave with you tonight

03:10.919 --> 03:12.539
still depends...

03:17.759 --> 03:19.259
Who is it?

03:26.159 --> 03:27.939
Mr. He?

03:29.560 --> 03:31.860
You two know each other?

03:35.599 --> 03:39.759
It was agreed that tonight
Miss Xiang Ning would be mine.

03:39.759 --> 03:42.620
[Xiang Ning]
Is this how Wanxiang Pavilion does business?

03:43.560 --> 03:45.400
The pavilion must've made a mistake.

03:45.400 --> 03:48.639
But seeing your fine looks and demeanor

03:48.639 --> 03:52.419
makes me reluctant to refuse.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.900
Then

03:57.919 --> 04:00.400
I will add another hundred taels.

04:00.400 --> 04:03.159
The handsome master is so generous.

04:03.159 --> 04:06.560
I find it hard to choose.

04:06.560 --> 04:08.879
Mr. He, aren't you busy
with marriage negotiations?

04:08.879 --> 04:11.759
What brings you to Wanxiang Pavilion
to compete with me for a woman?

04:11.759 --> 04:13.400
Mr. Meng, you misunderstand.

04:13.400 --> 04:15.159
I have never had any marriage negotiations.

04:15.159 --> 04:16.600
As for the reason I came here,

04:16.600 --> 04:19.040
I am sure you know it perfectly well.

04:19.040 --> 04:21.199
Why must you two masters fight?

04:21.199 --> 04:24.240
Why don't we spend the night together?

04:24.240 --> 04:27.160
However, I am feeling a bit tired today.

04:27.160 --> 04:28.720
Here at Wanxiang Pavilion,

04:28.720 --> 04:32.899
is there anything that clears the head,
calms the body, and adds a little pleasure?

04:34.959 --> 04:37.199
You are in the prime of your youth,

04:37.199 --> 04:38.720
vigorous and full of vitality.

04:38.720 --> 04:41.319
Surely you have no need of a boost?

04:41.319 --> 04:45.279
You're not like those rich young men
who are all show and nothing else.

04:45.279 --> 04:48.319
They can't enjoy themselves
without the Eternity Pills.

04:48.319 --> 04:51.620
But you do not need such things.

04:53.240 --> 04:57.439
Hearing about the Eternity Pills
has actually piqued my interest a bit.

04:57.439 --> 04:59.500
Does Wanxiang Pavilion have those pills?

05:00.959 --> 05:04.160
Handsome master, you're interested in those?

05:04.160 --> 05:06.959
But I will be honest with you.

05:06.959 --> 05:09.199
The Eternity Pills are quite rare now,

05:09.199 --> 05:11.439
and you can't buy them for gold.

05:11.439 --> 05:14.600
Wanxiang Pavilion no longer has any either.

05:14.600 --> 05:18.199
Are you worried we can't afford the price?

05:18.199 --> 05:21.720
Then I'll have to buy a few
and try them today.

05:21.720 --> 05:24.000
You sure do have deep pockets.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.759
However, this batch of Eternity Pills

05:25.759 --> 05:28.560
was already completely consumed
by guests three days ago.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.699
So when can I have a chance to try?

05:31.480 --> 05:32.839
In another month,

05:32.839 --> 05:36.759
you two new guests
can wait for the new Eternity Pills.

05:36.759 --> 05:40.879
But the price will have gone up by then.

05:40.879 --> 05:42.860
We have to wait that long?

05:43.639 --> 05:47.399
Then why not just tell us
the source of the Eternity Pills?

05:47.399 --> 05:49.639
Please forgive me, honored guests.

05:49.639 --> 05:51.839
It is all my fault for lax discipline.

05:51.839 --> 05:53.560
The people below were muddle-headed

05:53.560 --> 05:56.000
and hung Xiang Ning's sign twice.

05:56.000 --> 05:59.519
Your silver was meant for Nan Nan's songs.

05:59.519 --> 06:02.800
And Xiang Ning's already booked
by an old client.

06:02.800 --> 06:05.720
Let me take you two masters to Nan Nan.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.439
We double the price.

06:07.439 --> 06:08.680
Masters,

06:08.680 --> 06:11.199
Wanxiang Pavilion has failed
to treat you well tonight.

06:11.199 --> 06:14.040
We won't take a single coin from you.

06:14.040 --> 06:17.899
Let it be considered our apology to you both.

06:18.600 --> 06:21.920
But the rules of the pavilion
can't be broken.

06:21.920 --> 06:25.100
Xiang Ning, go to the west wing now.

06:29.399 --> 06:30.839
Forget it.

06:30.839 --> 06:33.860
We are not the kind of people
who force a deal.

06:34.720 --> 06:36.480
Mr. He,

06:36.480 --> 06:39.620
why don't we seek our pleasure
elsewhere tonight?

06:43.519 --> 06:45.240
Miss,

06:45.240 --> 06:47.319
if you like it here,

06:47.319 --> 06:50.759
there's no need
to disguise yourself next time.

06:50.759 --> 06:53.740
My pavilion welcomes both men and women.

06:54.519 --> 06:58.959
Next time you come, I will have Xiang Ning
personally apologize to you.

06:58.959 --> 07:00.459
Fine.

07:10.399 --> 07:12.959
Mr. Meng, you're truly dashing.

07:12.959 --> 07:16.220
Seems you've gotten quite good
at playing the man now.

07:18.000 --> 07:20.079
Of course.

07:20.079 --> 07:23.279
Why did Your Majesty
come to Wanxiang Pavilion tonight?

07:23.279 --> 07:26.600
I heard about the Eternity Pills
from Di Nian and Zhi Shu.

07:26.600 --> 07:29.079
A bustling market by night
and the people at peace

07:29.079 --> 07:31.399
have always been what I desire in my heart.

07:31.399 --> 07:34.519
But Ling Yun Fei is like a ghost
haunting the night market,

07:34.519 --> 07:37.040
ready to tear the peace apart at any moment.

07:37.040 --> 07:40.759
Given Xiang Ning's reaction,
she seemed not to know Ling Yun Fei.

07:40.759 --> 07:42.639
But from what she said just now,

07:42.639 --> 07:45.959
the next batch of Eternity Pills
will soon arrive at Wanxiang Pavilion.

07:45.959 --> 07:47.600
If it is truly related to the Huxiao Gang,

07:47.600 --> 07:50.079
we can seize this opportunity
to capture Ling Yun Fei.

07:50.079 --> 07:51.800
If the Eternity Pills circulate in the realm,

07:51.800 --> 07:53.600
they'll bring ruin to the entire country.

07:53.600 --> 07:56.480
We must stop Ling Yun Fei's plot
as soon as possible.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.240
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

07:58.240 --> 08:01.980
I will do all I can
to keep this age of peace from falling.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.300
I trust you.

08:07.759 --> 08:09.439
But this matter is fraught with danger,

08:09.439 --> 08:10.879
with undercurrents surging.

08:10.879 --> 08:14.300
I will face it together with you.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.616
By the way,

08:19.616 --> 08:22.199
- I decreed a marriage to the Wens today.
- Congratulations, Your Majesty.

08:22.199 --> 08:24.019
You should congratulate Lord Xu.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.920
The Xu and Wen families
have always been close.

08:26.920 --> 08:30.959
And Lord Xu's son and the Wen daughter
are well-suited in every way,

08:30.959 --> 08:32.459
making a perfect match.

08:34.799 --> 08:38.740
Your Majesty is truly wicked.

08:40.120 --> 08:44.419
Then I wonder
if this arrangement pleases you.

08:47.320 --> 08:49.179
What does it have to do with me?

08:59.799 --> 09:02.799
Shazhou sugar! Sweet and tasty!

09:02.799 --> 09:03.799
Come on, masters.

09:03.799 --> 09:06.440
Our sugar is made with a secret recipe.

09:06.440 --> 09:08.159
So sweet it lingers on the tongue!

09:08.159 --> 09:09.659
Why not give it a try?

09:11.559 --> 09:15.320
How come I never saw this kind of treat
in Shazhou before?

09:15.320 --> 09:18.580
Shazhou's food is very different
from the capital's.

09:19.399 --> 09:20.899
Two, please.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.820
So sweet.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.820
Yes, so sweet.

10:42.159 --> 10:44.000
I meant the sugar.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.740
I also meant the sugar.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.000
Mr. He.

11:03.000 --> 11:04.500
Miss Situ.

11:06.759 --> 11:09.559
Miss Meng, you look quite dashing
in men's wear.

11:09.559 --> 11:11.039
Would you two care to join me

11:11.039 --> 11:13.820
for a quiet visit to Huiyin House tonight?

11:53.759 --> 11:55.259
Well played.

11:55.919 --> 11:59.519
I didn't expect you two
to be so well-acquainted

11:59.519 --> 12:02.720
that you even played a rare tune
in perfect harmony.

12:02.720 --> 12:04.519
It surprises me greatly.

12:04.519 --> 12:07.000
Do you two have some history together?

12:07.000 --> 12:08.840
It is very strange.

12:08.840 --> 12:10.360
I don't know why,

12:10.360 --> 12:13.720
but I feel somehow familiar with this tune.

12:13.720 --> 12:15.519
It's a tune passed down in my family.

12:15.519 --> 12:18.600
Perhaps you heard it before
when you came here, Miss Meng,

12:18.600 --> 12:21.720
and constant exposure
makes it sound familiar to you.

12:21.720 --> 12:24.960
I come here often,
but I have never heard this tune.

12:24.960 --> 12:29.820
Miss Situ, did you specially
prepare this tune for Miss Meng?

12:30.840 --> 12:34.720
Every time you come,
you only care about probing into my past,

12:34.720 --> 12:36.559
full of curiosity about me.

12:36.559 --> 12:39.960
When has your mind ever been on the music?

12:39.960 --> 12:41.840
But you have a sharp mind, Mr. He.

12:41.840 --> 12:44.200
This tune is called Heart-Calming Chant,

12:44.200 --> 12:48.039
best for calming the mind
and soothing the emotions.

12:48.039 --> 12:50.902
Today I played it especially for Miss Meng.

12:50.902 --> 12:53.000
I've always wanted to help you
with your troubles.

12:53.000 --> 12:56.399
If there is anything I can help with,
please do not hesitate to ask.

12:56.399 --> 13:00.240
Huiyin House and Wanxiang Pavilion
are both on Changle Street.

13:00.240 --> 13:03.580
I wonder if you know anything
about Wanxiang Pavilion.

13:04.360 --> 13:08.000
Wanxiang Pavilion's girls
take their beauty and health quite seriously

13:08.000 --> 13:09.799
and often come to me for advice.

13:09.799 --> 13:14.120
The person they mention most often
is the Pavilion Master, Liu Ru Yan.

13:14.120 --> 13:16.799
She was once just an ordinary girl there.

13:16.799 --> 13:20.639
Now she has become the person
in charge of Wanxiang Pavilion

13:20.639 --> 13:23.559
and has earned every girl's absolute loyalty

13:23.559 --> 13:25.039
and admiration.

13:25.039 --> 13:27.759
They say she treats them
better than their own mothers.

13:27.759 --> 13:31.519
Such skill in winning people's hearts
is truly astonishing.

13:31.519 --> 13:35.799
Sounds like she has someone backing her.

13:35.799 --> 13:37.480
You're wise, Mr. He.

13:37.480 --> 13:40.080
It's said that person
goes to Wanxiang Pavilion every month,

13:40.080 --> 13:42.200
but no one has ever seen their true face.

13:42.200 --> 13:45.000
Very little is known about that person.

13:45.000 --> 13:47.879
Miss Situ, have you ever dealt with Ms. Liu?

13:47.879 --> 13:49.840
I have not met her in person.

13:49.840 --> 13:52.559
But she's quite fond of a fragrant bath here.

13:52.559 --> 13:55.296
She sends for it on certain days every month.

13:55.296 --> 13:58.279
The fragrant bath
is made with the herb Peilan.

13:58.279 --> 14:01.360
It's freshly made daily
to keep the herb's rich, fragrant scent,

14:01.360 --> 14:04.039
and it wards off chill, sharpens the mind,

14:04.039 --> 14:05.399
and nourishes the whole body.

14:05.399 --> 14:08.519
So does this fragrant bath
have any special features

14:08.519 --> 14:10.799
compared to ordinary medicinal baths?

14:10.799 --> 14:13.159
Of course there are

14:13.159 --> 14:14.659
some special features.

14:23.240 --> 14:26.240
It's a secret prescription
from a physician of old.

14:26.240 --> 14:28.039
It balances yin and yang

14:28.039 --> 14:30.080
and heightens the joys of intimacy,

14:30.080 --> 14:32.759
a wonderful method that serves both purposes.

14:32.759 --> 14:35.039
You won't find it in just any brothel.

14:35.039 --> 14:39.080
I do not know
if there is a connection between the two.

14:39.080 --> 14:41.000
Miss Situ,

14:41.000 --> 14:44.240
if Ms. Liu needs this medicine again,

14:44.240 --> 14:46.159
could you inform me?

14:46.159 --> 14:47.840
Certainly.

14:47.840 --> 14:49.919
Thank you for telling me, Miss Situ.

14:49.919 --> 14:53.700
I offer you a toast
with tea in place of wine.

14:55.519 --> 14:58.220
We are sisters. Why such formality?

15:00.519 --> 15:03.240
I didn't expect that you two

15:03.240 --> 15:06.139
would now address each other as sisters.

15:07.240 --> 15:10.200
Miss Situ has helped me out many times.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.720
When she was healing me,

15:11.720 --> 15:14.120
we felt our temperaments matched

15:14.120 --> 15:15.879
and thus became close.

15:15.879 --> 15:17.799
If between you two,

15:17.799 --> 15:21.799
there is truly mutual honesty, that is good.

15:21.799 --> 15:25.000
Your words today
seem to carry deeper meaning.

15:25.000 --> 15:26.600
You care about Miss Meng so much.

15:26.600 --> 15:28.440
It makes me a little jealous.

15:28.440 --> 15:30.200
I remember last time you came,

15:30.200 --> 15:31.679
you said I was your confidante.

15:31.679 --> 15:34.440
How come you have forgotten me so quickly?

15:34.440 --> 15:37.480
You have too many confidantes.

15:37.480 --> 15:39.720
When would it ever be my turn?

15:39.720 --> 15:43.480
I am merely a little curious
about your relationship.

15:43.480 --> 15:45.440
I regard Miss Meng as a dear friend,

15:45.440 --> 15:47.340
and that is completely sincere.

15:48.240 --> 15:50.220
And how do you regard Miss Meng?

15:55.320 --> 15:57.460
Of course, it's also sincere.

16:02.000 --> 16:05.960
The person Miss Situ spoke of
is undoubtedly Ling Yun Fei.

16:05.960 --> 16:08.600
It seems Liu Ru Yan
is deeply entangled with him.

16:08.600 --> 16:11.440
She found out that I was actually a woman.

16:11.440 --> 16:13.340
Could she guess my purpose in coming?

16:13.960 --> 16:16.159
Even if we alert them, it doesn't matter.

16:16.159 --> 16:19.000
I suspect Ling Yun Fei will not stop for now.

16:19.000 --> 16:21.240
Although Miss Situ helped us this time,

16:21.240 --> 16:24.200
you still need to be more vigilant
in your dealings with her.

16:24.200 --> 16:26.139
You can't trust people too easily.

16:27.360 --> 16:29.840
Your Majesty seems rather close to Situ Xue,

16:29.840 --> 16:32.000
yet you can't bear to see me near her?

16:32.000 --> 16:36.259
Looking at you,
could it be that you're jealous?

16:38.519 --> 16:40.399
You're flattering yourself.

16:40.399 --> 16:43.259
I never stoop
to compete for favor with others.

17:01.919 --> 17:04.960
Master, I've followed your instructions

17:04.960 --> 17:07.480
and revealed
Ling Yun Fei's whereabouts to her.

17:07.480 --> 17:11.480
But will this move affect our grand plan
for the Eternity Pills?

17:11.480 --> 17:12.960
It doesn't matter.

17:12.960 --> 17:15.440
If Ling Yun Fei
were truly that easy to capture,

17:15.440 --> 17:17.440
he wouldn't still be walking around free.

17:17.440 --> 17:20.799
Even if you didn't tell her,
she would still investigate to the end.

17:20.799 --> 17:23.799
It is better to use this
to earn a measure of her trust.

17:23.799 --> 17:26.720
But if Meng Ting Hui truly succeeds--

17:26.720 --> 17:27.839
That would be even better.

17:27.839 --> 17:31.559
In that case, everything will belong
to our Blood Moon Society.

17:31.559 --> 17:34.480
We've established the Poisoned People's Mound
in Wangxian Valley.

17:34.480 --> 17:36.599
But Ling Yun Fei harbors hidden ambitions,

17:36.599 --> 17:39.119
daring to lay a finger
on our society's foundation.

17:39.119 --> 17:41.839
Looks like he wants the Eternity Pill trade
all to himself.

17:41.839 --> 17:44.619
Too bad he's misjudged his opponent.

17:45.920 --> 17:48.599
The weapons purchase this time
has depleted the Eternity Pill profits.

17:48.599 --> 17:50.519
It was originally your trade.

17:50.519 --> 17:52.000
We can't let Ling Yun Fei touch it.

17:52.000 --> 17:54.680
Since he harbors ill intentions,

17:54.680 --> 17:58.839
let's use Meng Ting Hui
to eradicate him for us.

17:58.839 --> 18:00.240
Indeed.

18:00.240 --> 18:03.220
The more chaotic the chess game, the better.

18:03.839 --> 18:05.680
Continue to win over Meng Ting Hui.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.799
When the time is right,

18:07.799 --> 18:10.500
add fuel to the fire for her.

18:14.039 --> 18:16.759
Your hand is still bleeding.

18:16.759 --> 18:18.259
Just a minor wound.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.599
For ten years,

18:21.599 --> 18:23.119
every full moon night,

18:23.119 --> 18:26.480
you offer your own blood as a sacrifice
to the Zhongwan royal family.

18:26.480 --> 18:27.720
If the Blood Moon Society's blade

18:27.720 --> 18:30.279
loses its edge because of a minor wound,

18:30.279 --> 18:34.039
I fear those spirits would blame me
for failing to protect you.

18:34.039 --> 18:39.480
Spilling this blood
for the spirits of Zhongwan is not a waste.

18:39.480 --> 18:41.140
However,

18:43.599 --> 18:46.420
you overstepped your bounds today.

18:47.119 --> 18:50.759
I simply couldn't bear to see you wounded.

18:50.759 --> 18:54.619
A physician will tend to Master's hand.

18:55.400 --> 18:57.299
I overstepped.

18:58.920 --> 19:00.579
Remember your place.

19:01.240 --> 19:02.740
You may both leave.

19:36.559 --> 19:38.059
Master.

19:39.912 --> 19:42.339
Come, Lv Da, sit down and eat together.

19:43.279 --> 19:44.779
Thank you, Master.

19:48.000 --> 19:49.500
Ru Yan is here.

19:57.559 --> 20:00.160
What? Missed me?

20:00.160 --> 20:01.956
Couldn't wait for my visit?

20:01.956 --> 20:04.440
Alright, stop it.

20:04.440 --> 20:07.519
Meng Ting Hui
came to Wanxiang Pavilion today.

20:07.519 --> 20:08.720
In her words,

20:08.720 --> 20:11.539
she kept fishing for information
about the Eternity Pills.

20:15.559 --> 20:18.980
To do business right, we need
to spread our reach across all of Ning.

20:20.000 --> 20:21.619
She'll find out sooner or later.

20:22.279 --> 20:23.779
What we are gambling on

20:24.519 --> 20:26.440
is that she can't catch us.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.940
But

20:28.720 --> 20:32.424
the court's wanted posters
have been up for half a month now,

20:32.424 --> 20:35.119
and your brother still acts recklessly.

20:35.119 --> 20:36.680
He is a hypocrite.

20:36.680 --> 20:39.400
He sent people
to assault Meng Ting Hui himself

20:39.400 --> 20:40.960
yet framed the Master for it.

20:40.960 --> 20:42.640
His heart is much blacker than ours.

20:42.640 --> 20:46.160
Back when our gambling house business
was raking in gold daily,

20:46.160 --> 20:47.400
Master listened to him

20:47.400 --> 20:51.039
and used female students
to secure officials and pave the way for him.

20:51.039 --> 20:53.559
Now, the court has issued a ban on gambling,

20:53.559 --> 20:54.960
and our business is gone.

20:54.960 --> 20:57.000
And he still won't lift a finger by far.

20:57.000 --> 20:59.339
We used to work for others' gain.

21:01.200 --> 21:03.059
Now, the Eternity Pill trade

21:04.200 --> 21:06.700
is our own real business.

21:08.839 --> 21:11.700
The "Huxiao" in our gang's name
means tiger's roar.

21:13.279 --> 21:16.180
I want the whole realm of the Ning Empire

21:16.799 --> 21:19.000
to hear my roar.

21:19.000 --> 21:21.759
If Meng Ting Hui dares to obstruct me,

21:21.759 --> 21:24.460
I will let her try this newly made poison.

21:28.119 --> 21:29.779
Focus on making money now.

21:32.480 --> 21:33.920
Rest assured.

21:33.920 --> 21:35.279
The Eternity Pills

21:35.279 --> 21:38.004
are in high demand at Wanxiang Pavilion,

21:38.004 --> 21:41.319
and we've made ten thousand taels in days.

21:41.319 --> 21:46.059
Whatever you want to do, I'll stand with you.

21:47.599 --> 21:49.099
Here.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.460
Stop at once.

21:57.480 --> 22:01.359
Isn't this our virtuous chancellor,
meritorious in water control?

22:01.359 --> 22:02.980
What a rare guest.

22:03.680 --> 22:05.440
Your esteemed presence

22:05.440 --> 22:08.400
brings light to our humble Huxiao Gang.

22:08.400 --> 22:11.140
The irrelevant should not be present.

22:12.060 --> 22:14.440
This is the woman I love most,

22:14.440 --> 22:16.640
and this is my sworn brother
through thick and thin.

22:16.640 --> 22:19.299
You can speak freely before them.

22:21.160 --> 22:23.680
Trusting all sorts of shady people,

22:23.680 --> 22:25.539
you really aren't picky.

22:29.400 --> 22:31.359
If I don't trust them,

22:31.359 --> 22:32.960
should I trust you, my sanctimonious,

22:32.960 --> 22:35.059
utterly hypocritical brother?

22:37.068 --> 22:40.299
You always hide in the shadows,
utterly cowardly,

22:47.064 --> 22:48.859
not even daring to show your face.

22:53.244 --> 22:55.559
Immediately stop the trade of those pills

22:55.559 --> 22:57.240
and leave the capital within three days.

22:57.240 --> 22:59.559
On what grounds?
The gambling house was shut down,

22:59.559 --> 23:01.519
and we finally found a new source of income.

23:01.519 --> 23:03.000
Why must we listen to you?

23:03.000 --> 23:05.160
Are you afraid you won't get a cut?

23:05.160 --> 23:06.599
Don't worry.

23:06.599 --> 23:10.104
You'll have your cut of the pill profits.

23:10.104 --> 23:11.480
I told you long ago,

23:11.480 --> 23:14.339
you can touch anything except drugs.

23:15.519 --> 23:18.500
Only a trade that gains without killing
will last long.

23:19.279 --> 23:20.779
Listen to him.

23:21.468 --> 23:23.599
How righteous my brother is!

23:23.599 --> 23:28.299
You made me do
all the dirty, tiring work for you,

23:28.920 --> 23:29.920
including killing--

23:29.920 --> 23:31.160
Shut up!

23:31.160 --> 23:33.680
Meng Ting Hui's blade is almost at your neck,

23:33.680 --> 23:35.920
and you're still so ignorant?

23:35.920 --> 23:37.559
Lord Gu, with all your might,

23:37.559 --> 23:40.920
why don't you deal with Meng Ting Hui
for Yun Fei?

23:40.920 --> 23:44.319
All these years,
he's always been the blade for you.

23:44.319 --> 23:46.059
A mere prostitute

23:46.799 --> 23:48.420
dares to question me?

23:52.200 --> 23:54.180
Brother, would you like to try

23:55.752 --> 23:58.119
the taste of pure ecstasy?

23:58.119 --> 23:59.160
Are you crazy?

23:59.160 --> 24:01.428
Yes, I am crazy.

24:01.428 --> 24:03.279
From the moment
you made me kidnap Yuan Ling Yi

24:03.279 --> 24:04.440
while you played the hero

24:04.440 --> 24:06.640
and then turned around and put me in prison,

24:06.640 --> 24:07.880
I have already been crazy.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.960
But I soon got you out
and gave you a new identity.

24:09.960 --> 24:11.980
Should I thank you for that?

24:13.559 --> 24:15.059
In this lifetime,

24:16.480 --> 24:18.700
I've only thanked you for one thing.

24:26.880 --> 24:28.240
You cur!

24:28.240 --> 24:30.599
You think you can hang around on our turf?

24:30.599 --> 24:32.064
I'm not a cur!

24:32.064 --> 24:34.000
I have my parents and my brother.

24:34.000 --> 24:35.500
Beat him!

24:42.108 --> 24:44.579
Who dares bully my brother?

24:50.784 --> 24:52.940
Yun Fei, are you alright?

24:55.200 --> 24:56.740
I'm your brother.

24:59.616 --> 25:01.559
Brother.

25:01.559 --> 25:05.039
If anyone bullies you again, come find me.

25:05.039 --> 25:06.759
I will protect you.

25:06.759 --> 25:09.319
He's always remembered the word "brother".

25:09.319 --> 25:12.380
And you? You use him every time,

25:13.160 --> 25:15.759
treating your bonds as bargaining chips

25:15.759 --> 25:17.559
and making him willingly be your blade

25:17.559 --> 25:19.400
and your stepping stone.

25:19.400 --> 25:23.000
You've certainly
calculated this deal shrewdly.

25:23.000 --> 25:26.440
It's because you're my brother
that I won't let you near drugs.

25:26.440 --> 25:29.640
All these years, we've cooperated flawlessly
in other businesses.

25:29.640 --> 25:31.140
Why must you...

25:32.799 --> 25:34.240
You vicious woman!

25:34.240 --> 25:36.740
If you truly care for him, tell him to stop.

25:38.960 --> 25:42.000
Yun Fei, listen to my advice.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.700
Lay low for a while.

25:50.079 --> 25:53.000
If I can't escape, neither can you.

25:53.000 --> 25:54.920
Lv Da, see him out.

25:54.920 --> 25:56.420
Yes, Master.

25:58.960 --> 26:02.380
Lord Gu, this way, please.

26:05.440 --> 26:06.940
Please.

26:28.200 --> 26:32.240
Miss Situ said she would send word
to Bofeng House before sunset.

26:32.240 --> 26:35.040
It is already late.
Why is there still no word?

26:35.040 --> 26:36.768
It's here.

26:36.768 --> 26:39.420
Miss Meng, the word is here.

26:41.376 --> 26:44.720
[Liu Ru Yan fetched the fragrant bath]

26:44.720 --> 26:46.160
According to Xiang Ning,

26:46.160 --> 26:48.359
the new Eternity Pills
reach the capital in a month.

26:48.359 --> 26:50.599
As the woman who shares Ling Yun Fei's bed,

26:50.599 --> 26:52.119
Liu Ru Yan handles the pill business for him

26:52.119 --> 26:53.440
and surely knows a great deal.

26:53.440 --> 26:55.119
They are meeting in secret today.

26:55.119 --> 26:57.228
We must seize the chance
to capture Ling Yun Fei

26:57.228 --> 26:58.319
and intercept those pills.

26:58.319 --> 26:59.359
Yes!

26:59.359 --> 27:01.519
Zhi Li, report to His Majesty immediately.

27:01.519 --> 27:03.019
We will split up.

27:42.359 --> 27:43.680
Honored guests, please stop.

27:43.680 --> 27:46.920
This is our master's private chamber.
You can't break in.

27:46.920 --> 27:49.519
Censorate officers on duty. Stand aside.

27:49.519 --> 27:51.960
You are the master from that day?

27:51.960 --> 27:54.079
- The Pavilion Master is bathing--
- If you stop us again,

27:54.079 --> 27:55.859
you'll be held for obstruction.

27:57.599 --> 28:00.672
Light Cavalry, on my order!
No one is to approach!

28:00.672 --> 28:02.216
Yes!

28:08.436 --> 28:09.968
Ms. Liu.

28:11.496 --> 28:14.539
Miss Meng, shall Captain Di and I just...

28:35.759 --> 28:37.259
Yin Qing.

28:42.804 --> 28:45.140
Miss Meng, I don't think I should come in...

28:47.559 --> 28:50.220
Miss Meng, what...

28:59.508 --> 29:01.028
Miss Meng,

29:02.319 --> 29:03.819
she is already dead.

29:05.640 --> 29:07.140
Pavilion Master!

29:11.599 --> 29:13.128
No way.

29:13.128 --> 29:15.980
She was just speaking with us.

29:16.776 --> 29:18.308
How can this be?

29:25.160 --> 29:29.180
Who... who killed you?

29:31.319 --> 29:35.700
Miss Meng, do you think
Ling Yun Fei silenced her?

29:43.359 --> 29:45.564
Do not jump to conclusions.

29:45.564 --> 29:47.140
The blood is not yet dry.

29:48.559 --> 29:50.579
The killer couldn't have gone far.

29:52.680 --> 29:54.299
Miss Meng,

29:55.000 --> 29:57.940
you must avenge the Pavilion Master!

29:58.759 --> 30:00.700
If you want to avenge her,

30:01.519 --> 30:03.440
tell us everything you know.

30:03.440 --> 30:06.400
The Eternity Pills, Ling Yun Fei,
and everything else.

30:06.400 --> 30:09.240
Speak! Do you want the real killer
to go free?

30:09.240 --> 30:10.740
Miss Meng,

30:11.688 --> 30:14.160
on the surface, Wanxiang Pavilion
is Ms. Liu's business,

30:14.160 --> 30:17.519
but it's actually
Ling Yun Fei's money-making den.

30:17.519 --> 30:19.539
Have you ever seen Ling Yun Fei's true face?

30:20.920 --> 30:25.680
I occasionally heard the sounds
of a man and woman from her room.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.960
But the strange thing is,

30:26.960 --> 30:29.759
no one ever sees Ling Yun Fei
enter or leave Wanxiang Pavilion.

30:29.759 --> 30:33.528
As for the Eternity Pills,
we truly do not know where they come from.

30:33.528 --> 30:37.740
Miss Meng, you must seek justice
for the Pavilion Master.

30:38.359 --> 30:41.539
She can't just die without reason.

30:47.592 --> 30:49.759
Liu Ru Yan is suspected
of colluding with the Huxiao Gang

30:49.759 --> 30:51.319
and trafficking the Eternity Pills.

30:51.319 --> 30:52.819
And she died strangely.

30:53.799 --> 30:56.759
Captain Di, immediately
seal off Wanxiang Pavilion

30:56.759 --> 30:58.668
and detain all persons involved.

30:58.668 --> 31:01.824
You are both connected to this case
and a key witness.

31:01.824 --> 31:04.980
Come with me to another room
to await questioning.

31:10.599 --> 31:13.859
Miss Meng, what should we do now?

31:15.684 --> 31:17.759
Since they met in secret here,

31:17.759 --> 31:19.692
there must be some clues.

31:19.692 --> 31:21.000
Search carefully.

31:21.000 --> 31:23.004
Take all items back to the Censorate.

31:23.004 --> 31:24.512
Someone!

31:36.732 --> 31:38.288
Miss Meng.

31:52.839 --> 31:54.359
Miss Meng,

31:54.359 --> 31:58.359
as a prostitute,
she hid so much gold and jewels.

31:58.359 --> 32:01.720
So the most profitable trades
are the ones the nation has forbidden.

32:01.720 --> 32:03.220
Come here.

32:07.319 --> 32:09.359
This isn't by a master's hand,

32:09.359 --> 32:11.140
and the artistry's not very good.

32:12.119 --> 32:14.319
Could it contain a hidden secret?

32:14.319 --> 32:15.799
Is there anything else?

32:15.799 --> 32:17.279
Just these gold and jewels.

32:17.279 --> 32:19.700
- Take everything back to the Censorate.
- Yes.

32:20.440 --> 32:22.632
Now that Liu Ru Yan is dead,

32:22.632 --> 32:27.579
the clues we hoped to obtain from her
are completely severed.

32:34.212 --> 32:37.559
Your Majesty, Miss Meng did not find
Ling Yun Fei at Wanxiang Pavilion.

32:37.559 --> 32:41.079
Ling Yun Fei is cunning and suspicious.
So that's no surprise.

32:41.079 --> 32:42.839
But once he shows himself here,

32:42.839 --> 32:45.019
he'll be completely exposed.

32:53.599 --> 32:55.180
Liu Ru Yan is dead.

32:56.599 --> 32:58.872
She managed Wanxiang Pavilion for many years

32:58.872 --> 33:01.079
and must have given you many promises.

33:01.079 --> 33:03.924
"Once you enter my pavilion,
you are my sisters.

33:03.924 --> 33:07.220
When you leave my pavilion,
you will be above others."

33:08.000 --> 33:10.392
The Pavilion Master granted us refuge.

33:10.392 --> 33:11.900
She was

33:12.972 --> 33:15.339
a mountain of kindness to us.

33:16.640 --> 33:18.440
She mistakenly used her charm as a blade,

33:18.440 --> 33:22.599
not knowing that very blade
would one day turn back on its wielder.

33:22.599 --> 33:25.640
Her death today is the price.

33:25.640 --> 33:27.140
We...

33:28.400 --> 33:30.839
All we wanted was a way to live.

33:30.839 --> 33:33.700
You build your own way to live.

33:34.480 --> 33:36.119
If you are willing to start anew,

33:36.119 --> 33:39.288
medicine shops, tea houses,
and embroidery workshops

33:39.288 --> 33:40.788
can all take apprentices.

33:40.788 --> 33:42.319
It's better to live by your own hands

33:42.319 --> 33:44.119
than to rely on others' favors.

33:44.119 --> 33:46.572
Those willing to reform, register now.

33:46.572 --> 33:47.599
Once the case is settled,

33:47.599 --> 33:50.380
the Censorate
will arrange placements for you all.

33:52.248 --> 33:53.768
Should we go?

33:58.559 --> 33:59.880
Miss Meng, for your kindness,

33:59.880 --> 34:01.380
I am willing to try.

34:02.680 --> 34:03.924
I am also willing to try.

34:03.924 --> 34:05.240
We are also willing to try.

34:05.240 --> 34:08.880
We are also willing to try.

34:08.880 --> 34:14.699
Wanxiang Pavilion is hereby sealed,
never to reopen.

34:27.159 --> 34:28.699
The prey has appeared.

35:28.000 --> 35:30.159
Your Majesty,
these people are behaving strangely,

35:30.159 --> 35:32.260
as if their minds have been taken over.

35:47.079 --> 35:50.360
Your Majesty,
their identities have been verified.

35:50.360 --> 35:53.019
They're the capital residents
who went missing half a month ago.

35:53.712 --> 35:55.079
They're not the only ones.

35:55.079 --> 35:57.219
The Census Office conducted a full census

35:57.880 --> 35:59.039
and found that in the past year,

35:59.039 --> 36:01.840
villagers have kept vanishing
outside the capital.

36:01.840 --> 36:04.464
Keep your focus on these people.

36:04.464 --> 36:07.400
Also, what have you found with Liu Ru Yan?

36:07.400 --> 36:09.599
Only some gold and jewels were seized.

36:09.599 --> 36:11.119
Nothing unusual has come up so far.

36:11.119 --> 36:14.980
It seems the breakthrough
still lies with these people.

36:18.280 --> 36:19.820
Sir--

36:37.280 --> 36:39.159
The poison is unusual.

36:39.159 --> 36:40.280
Summon the coroner!

36:40.280 --> 36:41.780
Yes.

36:46.360 --> 36:47.900
Meng Ting Hui!

36:48.880 --> 36:50.880
You dared to kill Ru Yan!

36:50.880 --> 36:53.179
I will never let you go!

36:54.679 --> 36:56.179
Master.

36:57.408 --> 36:59.800
- Ru Yan.
- Master,

36:59.800 --> 37:03.119
you should take the brothers to avenge Ru Yan

37:03.119 --> 37:05.199
instead of...

37:05.199 --> 37:07.184
If Ru Yan were still alive,

37:08.148 --> 37:12.012
- she wouldn't want you to hurt yourself.
- Get out of my way!

37:12.012 --> 37:14.639
Don't think I won't raise a hand
against a brother.

37:14.639 --> 37:18.579
If beating me up can make you feel better,

37:19.519 --> 37:21.340
then just do it!

37:33.079 --> 37:36.280
Get out! All of you, get out!

37:36.280 --> 37:37.780
Get out!

38:59.679 --> 39:01.179
Yun Fei.

39:11.360 --> 39:12.860
Yun Fei.

39:22.360 --> 39:23.860
Ru Yan.

39:25.039 --> 39:26.539
Ru Yan.

39:30.639 --> 39:32.139
Ru Yan!
